  LatticeProb/Prob/Harris.lean
      adapted from percolation/Percolation/Literature/HarrisInequality.lean

  LatticeProb/Prob/ZeroOne.lean
      adapted from percolation/Percolation/Literature/ZeroOneLaw.lean
      (the abstract and product sections only)

  LatticeProb/Prob/HarrisVariants.lean
      adapted from percolation/Percolation/Literature/LocallyMonotoneFKG.lean
